ectual outcomes in children with congenital hypothyroidism.", "MOLINARI L:Molinari L is an author of a study on long-term intellectual outcomes in children with congenital hypothyroidism.", "ETTER K:Etter K is an author of a study on long-term intellectual outcomes in children with congenital hypothyroidism.", "TORRESANI T:Torresani T is an author recognized for contributions to the field of pediatric endocrinology, particularly in relation to congenital hypothyroidism. They have authored a study focusing on the long-term intellectual outcomes in children affected by this condition. Additionally, Torresani T is also a contributor to the European Society for Paediatric Endocrinology Consensus Guidelines on congenital hypothyroidism, further emphasizing their expertise and involvement in establishing best practices for the management of this disorder.", "LANG-MURITANO M:Lang-Muritano M is an author of a study on long-term intellectual outcomes in children with congenital hypothyroidism.", "JENNI OG:Jenni OG is an author of a study on long-term intellectual outcomes in children with congenital hypothyroidism.", "GRASBERGER H:Grasberger H is an author of a study on genetic causes of congenital hypothyroidism.", "REFETOFF S:Refetoff S is a prominent researcher recognized for significant contributions to the understanding of thyroid hormone action and related disorders. He has played a crucial role in the classification of inherited defects of thyroid hormone action, enhancing the scientific community's knowledge in this area. Additionally, Refetoff S is the author of a study that explores the genetic causes of congenital hypothyroidism, further underscoring his expertise and impact in the field of thyroid research.", "GROZINSKY-GLASBERG S:Grozinsky-Glasberg S is an author of a meta-analysis on thyroxine-triiodothyronine combination therapy versus thyroxine monotherapy.", "FRASER A:Fraser A is an author of a meta-analysis on thyroxine-triiodothyronine combination therapy 